Weather Prediction does not bundle third-party code. The material below is used by the project and keeps its own
terms.

Historical Weather Data for Indian Cities, published on Kaggle by Hitesh Soneji:
https://www.kaggle.com/datasets/hiteshsoneji/historical-weather-data-for-indian-cities. The eight files in data/ are
from this dataset, unchanged. See the dataset page for its terms.

The original notebook in notebooks/ was written following a Dataquest walkthrough on weather prediction.

Python packages, installed from PyPI by requirements.txt: NumPy, pandas, scikit-learn and SciPy (BSD 3-Clause).
